   120	
   121	"And what did he say was in it?" said Lira.
   122	
   123	"Big. Under. Comes up. Nobody's seen it whole." She rubbed her palms together. "He'd a name for it, the wold-wyrm; I'd not know a wold from a wash. He said that he'd not have gone down to those reeds for a year's salt."
