## Dense-scene rerouting

### Chapter 52, scene 2 (lines 62–104)

Enter on the bolt at the thirty-first step or on Teague's lantern showing dust at the chamber threshold. Let somebody notice a flame behaving wrongly before anyone names the twentieth step, and defer the cold or missing earth-smells until they are inside. Once in the chamber, have Cael begin with an actual measurement or discrepancy—dust, wall courses, ceiling clearance—instead of announcing that this is the proper catalogue and contrasting it with yesterday. The required two lamps, twentieth-step air change, chamber dimensions, carved walls, and Oryn/Karis exchange all remain, but the scene no longer repeats either source sentence's entrance and explanatory order.

Chapter 52 scene 3 needs only the local reorder described in the table; it does not require wholesale restructuring.

